[
read loop:
[>              sentinel
[>2^+?>X<       check if state one
=>^?>XX<        invert for if else
[+31.Z]X<       if state zero do ts
[+34.Z<34+>3+>3+>24+>7+>24+>3+>3+<33
]X>             increment neighbors
]>3+10.Z>2      newline
]>30            go to first sentinel

update loop:
[>              sentinel
[>=-3>^+<       if count three birth
[+              if count two stay
[>3Z<3Z         else die
]>Z<            if count two stay
]X[->2Z+<2]XZ>2 if count three birth
]>5]>30         go to first sentinel
]
